A correct solution should recursively traverse the tree to find the common ancestor, as shown below:
```python
def hca(root, node1, node2):
    if not root:
        return None
    if root == node1 or root == node2:
        return root
    left = hca(root.left, node1, node2)
    right = hca(root.right, node1, node2)
    if left and right:
        return root
    return left if left else right
```
